=============== ACCESS =================
 
If you have gopher, the archive is browsable with the command:
   gopher -p academic/academic gopher.eff.org
 
The archive is also accessible via anonymous ftp and email. Ftp to
ftp.eff.org (192.77.172.4). It is in directory pub/academic/academic.
For email access to a file or directory, send email to
archive-server@eff.org. Include the line:
 
send acad-freedom/academic <filenames>
   OR
send acad-freedom/academic/<directoryname> README
 
where <filenames> is a list of the files that you want or
<directoryname> is the name of the directory you want. File README
is a detailed description of the items in the directory.
 
For more information or to make contributions, contact J.S. Greenfield
(greeny@eff.org).
